            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-hardcoding-cost",
        "moduleId": "repetition-to-generic",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "模型补充：硬编码文件名的代价",
        "markdown": "在 recipe 里重复写目标名和依赖名，真正的问题不是多打几个字，而是同一份信息出现了两处来源：规则头写一次，命令里再写一次。改名、换目录或新增输入时两处必须同步修改，漏改一处就会出现命令操作的文件与规则声明的目标不一致，而且这种错误通常要到执行时才暴露。自动变量把命令中的文件名绑定回规则头里的目标与依赖，消除了这处重复。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "repetition-problem"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "target-automatic-variable",
        "moduleId": "target-automatic-variable",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "definition",
        "title": "教材：$@ 表示当前目标",
        "markdown": "在规则的 recipe（命令）中写 `$@`，表示“这条规则的目标”。教材把写死输出文件名的版本：\n\n```makefile\n# Regenerate results for \"Moby Dick\"\nresults/moby_dick.csv : data/moby_dick.txt $(COUNT)\n\t$(RUN_COUNT) data/moby_dick.txt > results/moby_dick.csv\n```\n\n改写为：\n\n```makefile\n# Regenerate results for \"Moby Dick\"\nresults/moby_dick.csv : data/moby_dick.txt $(COUNT)\n\t$(RUN_COUNT) data/moby_dick.txt > $@\n```\n\nMake 为每条规则分别定义 `$@` 的值，所以它总是指向该条规则自己的目标。教材也直言这个名字并不直观，`$TARGET` 一类写法会更好懂，但这是 Make 既定的约定。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-dacd3293b5aedfe0e5a195bd",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000059"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "Automating Analyses with Make",
                "Automatic Variables"
              ],
              "lineStart": 5607,
              "lineEnd": 5682,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "a7c0c856212ca9bcbae3a9741739c4110c65bae06fa9fbe5f6f177780301bc8e"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-at-scope",
        "moduleId": "target-automatic-variable",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "note",
        "title": "模型补充：$@ 按规则取值",
        "markdown": "`$@` 的值属于当前这条规则，不在规则之间共享。因此把一条规则复制给另一个目标时，`$@` 会自动指向新目标，命令里的输出位置也随之一致。需要提醒的是，这种自动跟随只在目标名改动时成立；如果依赖或输出路径结构发生变化，仍然要检查规则头和命令是否都表达了你想要的关系。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "target-automatic-variable"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "all-prerequisites",
        "moduleId": "prerequisite-automatic-variables",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "mechanism",
        "title": "教材：$^ 表示全部前置条件",
        "markdown": "`$^` 表示“规则中的全部前置条件”。教材尝试用它替换命令里显式列出的依赖：\n\n```makefile\n# Regenerate results for \"Moby Dick\"\nresults/moby_dick.csv : data/moby_dick.txt $(COUNT)\n\t$(RUN_COUNT) $^ > $@\n```\n\n但这个版本并不工作。规则的前置条件既包括小说文件，也包括统计程序。Make 展开 recipe 后，得到的命令把程序 `bin/countwords.py` 当作数据文件处理：\n\n```bash\npython bin/countwords.py data/moby_dick.txt bin/countwords.py >\n  results/moby_dick.csv\n```",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-dacd3293b5aedfe0e5a195bd",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000059"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "Automating Analyses with Make",
                "Automatic Variables"
              ],
              "lineStart": 5607,
              "lineEnd": 5682,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "a7c0c856212ca9bcbae3a9741739c4110c65bae06fa9fbe5f6f177780301bc8e"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-why-fails",
        "moduleId": "prerequisite-automatic-variables",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "模型补充：为什么 $^ 会出错",
        "markdown": "问题不在 `$^` 本身，而在规则把两类前置条件并排写在了同一条依赖列表里：一类是待处理的数据文件，另一类是执行处理的工具程序。`$^` 只是忠实地把全部前置条件展开到命令中，于是 `bin/countwords.py` 也被当成输入交给 `python`。因此使用 `$^` 前应先问：这条命令是否把所有前置条件都当作同类输入？如果其中有工具、配置或只用于触发重建的文件，`$^` 就不适合直接照搬。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "all-prerequisites",
            "target-automatic-variable"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "first-prerequisite",
        "moduleId": "prerequisite-automatic-variables",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "definition",
        "title": "教材：$< 表示第一个前置条件",
        "markdown": "Make 用另一个自动变量 `$<` 解决上面的问题，它表示“只有第一个前置条件”。使用后规则写成：\n\n```makefile\n# Regenerate results for \"Moby Dick\"\nresults/moby_dick.csv : data/moby_dick.txt $(COUNT)\n\t$(RUN_COUNT) $< > $@\n```\n\n此时命令只把 `data/moby_dick.txt` 作为输入，统计程序虽仍在依赖列表中，却不会被展开进命令参数。教材同时提醒：采用这种写法后，*Jane Eyre* 那条同类规则也应一起更新。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
